  "nodes": {
    "hub": {
      "text": "陆公子。刚才堂上没说完？行，你问。不过我先说清楚：我只认账，也只认证据。",
      "emotion": "cold_smile",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "自证清白了？不错。看来你不是草包。不过——这只是第一关。后面的水，比你想的深。",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cold_smile",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "self_cleared"
            },
            {
              "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "阿贵招了？……有意思。他说什么了？",
          "speaker_id": "shen_qingyue",
          "emotion": "cold_fury",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "你跟死者什么关系？",
          "goto": "intro",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "案发前一天你跟周德茂吵架了？",
          "goto": "ask_quarrel",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "shen_talked_once"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true,
          "min_hub_visits": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "案发当晚你在做什么？",
          "goto": "ask_alibi",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "shen_talked_once"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true,
          "min_hub_visits": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "你认识老范吗？",
          "goto": "ask_fan_connection",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "shen_quarrel_told"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "你父亲的病，很严重？",
          "goto": "ask_father",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "evidence": "evidence_father_ledger"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "码头那晚——你没有回客栈吧？",
          "goto": "press_dock_timing",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "clue": "evidence_dock_timing"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "王大爷在下游看到有人打捞东西。",
          "goto": "press_salvage",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "clue": "evidence_salvage_mark"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "老范说——是个'药材行的姑娘'先找的他。",
          "goto": "press_connection",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "clue": "evidence_shen_connection"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "（对峙）沈姑娘。该你坐下来好好说了。",
          "goto": "confession_trigger",
          "type": "confrontation",
          "requires": {
            "all": [
              {
                "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
              },
              {
                "evidence": "evidence_cargo_silver"
              },
              {
                "clue": "evidence_salvage_mark"
              },
              {
                "clue": "evidence_shen_connection"
              },
              {
                "clue": "evidence_dock_timing"
              },
              {
                "evidence": "evidence_drug_capsule_shell"
              },
              {
                "evidence": "evidence_tongue_herb_residue"
              },
              {
                "evidence": "evidence_oil_lock_residue"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "阿贵已经招了。他说是你教他凿船的。",
          "goto": "react_agui_caught",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ],
          "hide_after_visit": true
        },
        {
          "text": "你父亲的病，值得你赌到这一步？",
          "goto": "ask_father_after",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
                },
                {
                  "evidence": "evidence_father_ledger"
                }
              ]
